 oul presence with the circle of Pachakuti Mesa Practitioners worldwide\, s
 trengthening the Great Work of our shamanic planetary tribe. The power tha
 t is being harnessed and transmitted is deep and sentient nourishment for 
 the Earth.\nLearn more about the Pachakuti Mesa Tradition Link-Up HERE.\nN
 OTE: If you cannot attend this ceremony live\, the video recording will be
  posted on THOTH’s Facebook and Instagram pages.\n\nMust use this link t
 o register and join: https://heartofthehealer.org/link-ups/\nCeremonialist
 : PMT Sanctioned Teachers
