X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Meetup Amcdance": "https://www.meetup.com/amcdance/events/314542258/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_amcdance
X-SOURCE:Asheville Movement Collective
UID:event_314542258@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260614T044638Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260626T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260626T210000
SUMMARY:AMC Friday Ecstatic Dance w/ Guest DJ Magdalyn
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nFriday\, June 26th\nEvening Dan
 ce Wave 7:00 pm \\- 9:00 pm \\| Warmup 7pm \\| Opening Circle 7:30pm\nGues
 t DJ Magdalyn \\| Facilitator Kris Hostikka\n\nIntention: TBA\n\nAbout the
  DJ\nMagdalyn (Wryn Magdalyn) debuted as a DJ in Asheville in the summer o
 f 2024\, aligning with the rise of Venus. With over a decade of experience
  curating festivals\, conscious gatherings\, and ecstatic dance waves in F
 loyd\, Virginia\, she brings a seasoned devotion to movement-centered musi
 c spaces. Now a regular presence on Asheville’s ecstatic dance floors\, 
 she is first and foremost a lover of the dance. Magdalyn crafts sets that 
 blend conscious lyrics\, world beats\, and juicy\, booty-shaking rhythms\,
  guiding dancers through immersive journeys that celebrate connection\, tr
 ansformation\, and the pleasure of being fully moved by music. https://sou
 ndcloud.com/wrynmagdalyn\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\n\\*\\* Please note that the dance
  starts at Warm up. The doors close promptly at Opening Circle and any tha
 t come late will be turned away. Please be on time to ensure a safe and se
 cure container. \\*\\*\nTicket Prices: $15 - $30 or name your price.\n\nNo
  one turned away for lack of funds!\nPre-registration Recommended:\n[https
 ://ashevillemovementcollective.org/4b6k](https://ashevillemovementcollecti
 ve.org/4b6k)\n\nVOLUNTEER!\n\nWe need volunteers. Volunteer and dance for 
 free! Register to volunteer at:\n[https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/
 volunteer/](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/volunteer/?fbclid=IwZX
 h0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgy
 MDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem
 _nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\n\nIMPORTANT ANNOUNCEMENTS:\n\nDoor will close at
  the beginning of the opening circle. Please note: NO ENTRY AFTER OPENING 
 CIRCLE BOTH WAVES!\n\nCollective agreements:\n[https://ashevillemovementco
 llective.org/our-dance/](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance
 /?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDI
 yMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhD
 ttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\n\nAbout AMC:\nAsheville Movement Co
 llective envisions a world that moves in harmony where all are free to be 
 their authentic selves within a loving community. Our mission and aim are 
 to inspire authenticity and healthy community through free-form dance by h
 osting dance waves for personal and community transformation. AMC is a 501
 (c)(3) nonprofit organization.\n\nLocation: 50 Bell Rd\, Asheville\, NC 28
 805\n\nSee you on the dance floor!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/amcdance/events/314542258/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260429T134328Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260429T134328Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
