SUMMARY:AMC Friday Ecstatic Dance w/ Guest DJ Bobcat
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nFriday\, July 17th\nEvening Dan
 ce Wave 7:00 pm \\- 9:00 pm \\| Warmup 7pm \\| Opening Circle 7:30pm\nGues
 t DJ Bobcat \\| Facilitator Kris Hostikka\n\nIntention: TBA\n\n## About Gu
 est DJ Bobcat\n\nBob Swoap crafts journeys that invite dancers to deeply c
 onnect: with themselves\, others\, nature\, and the music. He layers genre
 s and world rhythms into an emotionally engaging set. At Warren Wilson Col
 lege -- where he is professor of psychology and expressive arts therapy --
  Bob facilitates ecstatic dance as a part of the community wellness progra
 m\, bringing a grounded\, experienced presence to the floor. Favorite plac
 e to dance: outside at the WWC Pavilion.\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\n\\*\\* Please not
 e that the dance starts at Warm up. The doors close promptly at Opening Ci
 rcle and any that come late will be turned away. Please be on time to ensu
 re a safe and secure container. \\*\\*\nTicket Prices: $15 - $30 or name y
 our price.\n\nNo one turned away for lack of funds!\nPre-registration Reco
 mmended:\n\nVOLUNTEER!\n\nWe need volunteers. Volunteer and dance for free
 ! Register to volunteer at:\n[https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/volu
 nteer/](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/volunteer/?fbclid=IwZXh0bg
 NhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4
 OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrj
 KIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\n\nIMPORTANT ANNOUNCEMENTS:\n\nDoor will close at the
  beginning of the opening circle. Please note: NO ENTRY AFTER OPENING CIRC
 LE BOTH WAVES!\n\nCollective agreements:\n[https://ashevillemovementcollec
 tive.org/our-dance/](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance/?fb
 clid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjA
 zOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv
 2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\n\nAbout AMC:\nAsheville Movement Collec
 tive envisions a world that moves in harmony where all are free to be thei
 r authentic selves within a loving community. Our mission and aim are to i
 nspire authenticity and healthy community through free-form dance by hosti
 ng dance waves for personal and community transformation. AMC is a 501(c)(
 3) nonprofit organization.\n\nLocation: 50 Bell Rd\, Asheville\, NC 28805\
 n\nSee you on the dance floor!
