DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260727T181500
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260727T201500
SUMMARY:July 27 MIH Rehearsal at Mission
DESCRIPTION:Men in Harmony\nWith Men in Harmony at our a cappella vocal wo
 rkshops\, you can explore your vocal abilities by joining us for an intera
 ctive session that covers vocal training\, a cappella techniques\, and gro
 up singing tips. Our experienced director will guide you through the basic
 s of harmonizing\, breath control\, and performance skills. Get ready to d
 iscover the joy of making music together in a supportive environment. Come
  join us for an evening of fun songs and tags!\n**NEW LOCATION\, DAY and T
 IME!**\nMission Cancer Center\, 21 Hospital Drive. NOT the main Hospital!\
 n**Entrance to building parking is** on the Right side of the building\, o
 ff Hamiton St. An **immediate LEFT is** where the BIG Parking lot is locat
 ed. Come into the building **on the floor level**\, into the lobby and the
 re is a corridor on the right where the conference rooms are. **We'll be r
 ehearsing in conference room R122.**\n**NOTE: Please be on time as the out
 er doors will be locked after we start rehearsal.**
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/men-in-harmony/events/315215974/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260611T170059Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260611T170059Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Meetup Asheville 20S 40S Social Group": "https://www.meetup.com/asheville-20s-40s-social-group/events/wwtfwtyjckbkc/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_asheville_20s_40s_social_group
X-SOURCE:Asheville 20s-40s Social Group
UID:event_wwtfwtyjckbkc@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260614T044632Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260727T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260727T220000
SUMMARY:Game Night @ Archetype West Asheville
DESCRIPTION:Asheville 20s-40s Social Group\n\\*\\*This is a collaboration 
 with the Asheville's Bored Game Geeks\\*\\*\n\nBring your favorite game(s)
  or learn a new one – members are always happy to teach! See you there a
 nd have a blast!\n**Welcome to the Game Night Extravaganza!**\n\nCalling a
 ll dice-rollers\, card-shufflers\, and strategy-curious adventurers!\nAre 
 weeknights feeling a tad mundane? Fear not! We’ve got the antidote: **Bo
 ard Games\, Brews\, and Bliss**.\n\n**Our Mission:** To ignite laughter\, 
 forge alliances\, and maybe—just maybe—unleash a few friendly rivalrie
 s & battle to the death!\nNo PhD in rulebooks required! Whether you’re a
  Settlers of Catan enthusiast or a Code Names solving ninja\, or your firs
 t time touching a board game ***we will explain all the rules needed.***\n
 \nExpect:\n\n* **Beer on Tap**: Because rolling dice is better with a pint
  in hand.\n* **Low Brainpower Required**: We’re all about fun\, not Ferm
 at’s Last Theorem.\n* **Epic Showdowns**: Ticket to Ride routes\, Splend
 or gem heists\, and High stakes Camel Up.\n\nFeel free to request any game
  you’d like to play or bring your own. So gather your guild\, stack your
  resource cards\, and let the games begin! May your laughter be loud\, you
 r moves be bold\, and your victory dances be legendary.\n\nSee you at the 
 table!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/asheville-20s-40s-social-group/events
 /wwtfwtyjckbkc/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260225T024351Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260225T024351Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
